<title>USA: SOCCER-CONCACAF GROUP ONE STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CONCACAF GROUP ONE STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standings in World Cup soccer</p>
<p>CONCACAF group one semifinals after weekend matches (tabulate</p>
<p>under games played, won, drawn, lost, goals for, goals</p>
<p>against, points)</p>
<p> U.S.	  2   2  0  0   4  0   6</p>
<p> Costa Rica  1   1  0  0   1  0   3</p>
<p> Trinidad    3   0  1  2   1  4   1</p>
<p> Guatemala   1   0  1  1   1  3   1</p>
<p>(Top two from each group advance to six-country CONCACAF</p>
<p>qualifying finals, from which three progress to 1998 World Cup</p>
<p>finals in France.)</p>
</text>
